# A running balance: each row reads the row before it.

table Ledger

Date : Date
Memo : Text

Date       | Memo            | Amount
2025-01-03 | Opening deposit | 2500
2025-01-09 | Rent            | -1200
2025-01-15 | Groceries       | -86.40
2025-01-28 | Salary          | 3100
2025-02-02 | Electricity     | -64.15

Balance := (Ledger[*-1; Balance] // 0) + Amount
Average := Ledger[0..*; Amount].avg()
